Error [E0222]: A part of `CONFIG.name` cannot be moved independently
  --> tests/ui/static_partial_move.jet:11:34
    |
 11 |     size :: consume_name(^CONFIG.name)
    |                                  ^^^^
 Why: Persistent and static storage is shared state; safe lowering can only take or replace the complete root.
 Fix: Move or take `CONFIG.name` as a whole, or update it atomically.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0222
